{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Identity of the StableNew-managed Forge Neo runtime (runtime identity forge_webui). Owns installation identity, package identity, StableNew-owned runtime/config state, launch policy and external model/detector references only. It starts nothing (WebUIProcessManager is the sole lifecycle authority) and contains no generation settings. Not a production default: A1111 remains the default image backend.",
